T* (for them. Click the Entered on, Date, Module or Amount heading to sort the list \(click again to reverse) Tj
T* (it\). While it is in date order, the entries are grouped by the month of the transaction date \(not the day it) Tj
T* (was entered\): click a month to open it \(they start folded\), or untick "Group by month". Tick "To be) Tj
