T* (can tick or untick it. It is the same mark as "Looks right" in the side panel. A good routine: at the end of) Tj
T* (each day, turn on Unchecked only and work down the list until it is empty. When an entry was made is) Tj
T* (shown small, for reference. Click a row to see every detail in the side panel. Today's summary at the) Tj
